  "id": "kinesiophobia",
  "term": "Kinesiophobia",
  "definition": "Kinesiophobia is a mental health condition involving a lasting, irrational fear of movement after an injury. It is linked to feeling disabled by the injury and to catastrophic fears that movement will cause pain or reinjury.",
